#~ msgid "Reporting Bugs"
#~ msgstr "Prijavljivanje bug-ova"

#, fuzzy
#~| msgid ""
#~| "Like the rest of &kde;, &showfoto; is an Open Source project. This means "
#~| "that it relies on its users to play their part by, at least, reporting "
#~| "problems and suggesting possible improvements."
#~ msgid ""
#~ "&showfoto; is an Open Source project. This means that it relies on its "
#~ "users to play their part by, at least, reporting problems and suggesting "
#~ "possible improvements."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Kao i ostatak &kde;, &showfoto; je projekat Otvorenog izvora. Ovo znači "
#~ "da se oslanja na korisnike da pomognu barem prijavljivanjem problema i "
#~ "predlaganjem mogućih popravki."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "&showfoto; makes it as easy as possible for you to report bugs or suggest "
#~ "improvements. Wherever you are in the application the Help menu will "
#~ "include a Report Bugs option. This will display a message box with a "
#~ "highlighted link. Click on the link and your web browser will open the "
#~ "page for the reporting system. All the information required will already "
#~ "be filled in, just follow the instructions for completing your report."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "&showfoto; omogućava najlakše moguće prijavljivanje bagova i predlaganje "
#~ "unaprijeđenja. bilo gdje unutar aplikacije Pomoć meni uključuje opciju za "
#~ "prijavu bagova. Ovo prikazuje kutiju sa tekstom i istaknutom poveznicom. "
#~ "Pritisnite link i vaš internet pretraživač će otvoriti stranicu za "
#~ "izvještaj sistema. Sve tražene informacije će biti popunjene , samo "
#~ "pratite uputstva za završetak izvještaja."

#~ msgid "Support"
#~ msgstr "Podrška"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "&showfoto; is a community supported project, which means that users and "
#~ "developers support one another. If you become a regular user of "
#~ "&showfoto; you are encouraged to join the &showfoto; Users Mailing List. "
#~ "You can start off by asking questions of other &showfoto; users and "
#~ "hopefully soon you will be answering the support questions of others."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "&showfoto; je projekat podržan od zajednice, što znači da programeri i "
#~ "korisnici podržavaju jedni druge. Ako postanete regularni korisnik "
#~ "&showfoto; ohrabreni ste da se pridružite &showfoto; korisničkoj listi "
#~ "dopisianja. Možete započeti tako što postavite pitanje drugim &showfoto; "
#~ "korisnicima i vjerovatno ćete ubrzo dobiti odgovor podrške drugih "
#~ "korisnika."

#~ msgid "&showfoto; Users Mailing List joining instructions."
#~ msgstr "&showfoto; Dodavanje korisnika na listu dopisivanja."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You can also visit the <ulink url=\"http://www.digikam.org\">&digikam-"
#~ "app; Home Page.</ulink> for news of new releases and other &showfoto; "
#~ "related information."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Možete posjetiti <ulink url=\"http://www.digikam.org\">&digikam-app; "
#~ "Početnu stranicu.</ulink> za novosti i nove verzije i ostale informacije "
#~ "povezane sa &showfoto;."

#~ msgid "Getting Involved"
#~ msgstr "Uključiti se"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There are many ways that you can get involved with the continued "
#~ "development of &showfoto;. You do not need to be a software developer. "
#~ "You can help with documentation, translation and user interface design or "
#~ "just contribute really good ideas to the wish-list. You can also get "
#~ "involved by testing early development code as it is being developed and "
#~ "providing feedback to the developers. Of course, if you are a software "
#~ "developer then you can help to make &showfoto; the best digital "
#~ "photograph application there is."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Postoji mnogo načina na koji se možete uključiti u kontinualni razvoj "
#~ "&showfoto;. Ne morate biti softver programer. Možete pomoći sa "
#~ "dokumentacijom, prevodom i dizajnom korisničkog okruženja samo dodajte "
#~ "dobre ideje u listu želja. Možete se ulključiti i testiranjem početnog "
#~ "razvojnog koda kao razvojnu i povratnu informaciju programerima. Naravno "
#~ "ako ste softver dizajner onda možete pomoći da &showfoto; postane "
#~ "najbolja aplikacija za digitalne fotografije, koja postoji."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The best way to start getting involved with &showfoto; is to join the "
#~ "Developers Mailing List. <ulink url=\"https://mail.kde.org/mailman/"
#~ "listinfo/digikam-devel\">&showfoto; Developer Mailing List joining "
#~ "instructions.</ulink>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Najbolji način da se uključite u &showfoto; je da se pridružite "
#~ "programerskoj listi za dopisivanje. <ulink url=\"https://mail.kde.org/"
#~ "mailman/listinfo/digikam-devel\">&showfoto; Upute za pristupanje "
#~ "programerskoj listi za dopisivanje.</ulink>"

